#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "A Jackpot, filling. Wait in it."
msgstr "正在蓄满的头奖。在里面等着。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "The Junction. Bank here, and only here."
msgstr "路口。在此入账，仅限此处。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "A Royal Flush: four pads, held at once."
msgstr "皇家同花顺：四块垫子，同时占住。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "A mult die. Multiplies."
msgstr "倍率骰子。负责相乘。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "A drift, held. Note the turbo."
msgstr "持续漂移。注意加速。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "A pit. Do not."
msgstr "坑洞。别。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "A roundabout. Go round it."
msgstr "环岛。绕着走。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Oversight"
msgstr "监督"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Every table is watched."
msgstr "每张赌桌都在注视之下。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "The kart"
msgstr "卡丁车"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "A kart shall at all times be a kart."
msgstr "卡丁车应始终是一辆卡丁车。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Give way to anything bigger, faster, or on fire."
msgstr "遇到比你大、比你快或者着了火的东西，一律让行。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Overtaking is permitted on the left, on the right, and over the top where a ramp is."
msgstr "允许从左侧、从右侧超车；有坡道的地方，也可以从上方超车。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Signs and markings"
msgstr "标志与标线"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "A sign shall be obeyed by any kart able to read it."
msgstr "凡能读懂标志的卡丁车，均须遵守该标志。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Hazard stripes mean hazard. They are not decoration, whatever they look like."
msgstr "警示条纹表示危险。不管看着多像装饰，它们都不是。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Arrows on the floor point the way. Karts may go the other way at their own risk."
msgstr "地面箭头指示行进方向。卡丁车可以逆向行驶，后果自负。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Chips and pots"
msgstr "筹码与彩池"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Chips collected go to your pot. The pot is yours until it isn't."
msgstr "收集的筹码进入你的彩池。彩池归你所有，直到它不归你。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Only banked points are safe. Nothing else is. Not even this book."
msgstr "只有入账的分数才安全。别的都不安全。这本书也不例外。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "A kart that dies loses part of its pot. The remainder is the kart's own business."
msgstr "阵亡的卡丁车会损失部分彩池。剩下的，是卡丁车自己的事。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "When in doubt, the Junction is in the middle."
msgstr "如有疑问：路口就在正中间。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Pads and the mult"
msgstr "垫子与倍率"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "A Royal Flush is four pads held at once. It is not a plumbing matter."
msgstr "皇家同花顺是同时占住四块垫子。与水管通不通顺无关。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Mult multiplies. That is all it does, and it does it very well."
msgstr "倍率负责相乘。它只做这一件事，而且做得非常好。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Handling"
msgstr "操控"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Drifting is permitted in tight corners and encouraged in wide ones."
msgstr "急弯允许漂移，大弯鼓励漂移。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Nitro refills over time. Patience does not."
msgstr "氮气会随时间回满。耐心不会。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "On meeting a pit, the recommended procedure is: not that."
msgstr "遇到坑洞时，建议的处置流程是：别那样。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd scenes/ui/match_options.gd
msgid "Items"
msgstr "道具"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "An item held is an item not yet used. Use it."
msgstr "握在手里的道具，就是还没用掉的道具。用掉它。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "A shield is a hat for the whole kart."
msgstr "护盾就是给整辆卡丁车戴的帽子。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Oil goes on the floor, not on other drivers' feelings."
msgstr "油渍要洒在地上，别往其他车手心头火上浇油。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Jokers bend rules in your favor. This rule is not a joker."
msgstr "小丑牌会把规则扭向对你有利的一边。本条规则不是小丑牌，也不开玩笑。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Hazards"
msgstr "危险"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Shots bounce. Plan accordingly, or don't, and see what happens."
msgstr "子弹会反弹。请据此规划；不规划也行，看看会发生什么。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "A turret left running is a turret left running."
msgstr "开着没关的炮塔，就是开着没关的炮塔。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd scenes/ui/match_options.gd
msgid "Bots"
msgstr "机器人"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Bots drive like bots. Do not take it personally."
msgstr "机器人开车就像机器人。别往心里去。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "A bot that says gg means it, more or less."
msgstr "机器人说 gg，就是真心的，大概吧。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd scenes/ui/pad_sheets.gd scenes/ui/settings_screen.gd scripts/input/steam_actions.gd
msgid "Emotes"
msgstr "表情"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "An emote is a statement. A second emote is an argument."
msgstr "一个表情是一种表态。第二个表情就是吵架了。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Emoting while banking is permitted, and encouraged."
msgstr "入账时允许发表情，并予以鼓励。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Bounties"
msgstr "悬赏"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "A crown makes you a target. Wear it with pride, briefly."
msgstr "王冠会让你成为靶子。骄傲地戴着吧，反正戴不久。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "The bounty on your head is a compliment."
msgstr "你头上的悬赏是一种恭维。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Overtime is the same as time, only more so."
msgstr "加时与正常时间无异，只是更加如此。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "In sudden death, death is sudden."
msgstr "在突然死亡中，死亡来得很突然。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Examinations"
msgstr "考试"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Examiners are always right. Examiners are also bots."
msgstr "考官永远是对的。考官也是机器人。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Reading this far is itself an endorsement."
msgstr "读到这里，本身就是一项签注。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "No table shall open without human oversight."
msgstr "未经人工监督，任何赌桌不得开放。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "What the House sees, it keeps. What it keeps, it does not discuss."
msgstr "庄家看到的，庄家都会留存。庄家留存的，庄家概不讨论。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "A table out of view is a table out of order."
msgstr "脱离视线的赌桌，即为脱离秩序的赌桌。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Oversight is continuous, and total, and no reflection on the driver."
msgstr "监督是持续的、全面的，并不代表对驾驶员有任何看法。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Everything a kart needs to know, and a fair amount it does not. Revised for the %dth time, and still not finished."
msgstr "卡丁车需要知道的一切，外加不少它不需要知道的。已第 %d 次修订，仍未完成。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "“Impossible to put down. It shuts itself.”"
msgstr "“根本放不下。它自己会合上。”"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "“I read it cover to cover. Quickly.”"
msgstr "“我从头读到了尾。很快。”"

#. A piece of a sentence of filler in the Highway Code, nonsense in legalese: a subject, a verb, an object or the sentence's end, put together as "{subject} {verb} {object}{tail}".
#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "A learner"
msgstr "学员"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "“Bank first. Read later.”"
msgstr "“先入账，再阅读。”"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "The Junction"
msgstr "路口"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "ISBN 0-212-2120-K"
msgstr "ISBN 0-212-2120-K"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "212 CHIPS"
msgstr "212 枚筹码"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Final provisions"
msgstr "附则"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "This concludes the Highway Code of the Junction."
msgstr "路口交通法规至此结束。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "The holder, having read every word of it, is now fully informed, and will be asked about it."
msgstr "持有人已逐字读完全文，现已充分知悉，并将就此接受提问。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Any part of it not read is deemed read."
msgstr "未读部分，视为已读。"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "The End"
msgstr "全书完"

#: scenes/tutorial/school/theory_text.gd
msgid "Printed and bound at the Junction. No karts were harmed in the making of this book. Most were merely inconvenienced."
msgstr "于路口印刷装订。本书制作过程中，没有卡丁车受到伤害。大多数只是受了点折腾。"

