#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "MOST PARTICIPANTS DO NOT CASH OUT IN TIME. MOST PARTICIPANTS COME BACK."
msgstr "大多数参与者没能及时兑现。大多数参与者都会回来。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
