msgstr "这张赌桌上的机器人，开得更像你了一点。谢谢。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "THE HOUSE KNOWS HOW YOU TAKE A CORNER."
msgstr "庄家知道你怎么过弯。"

