#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Reaction time is a performance indicator."
msgstr "反应时间是一项绩效指标。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Capacity increased at no cost to the House."
msgstr "容量已提升，庄家零成本。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Chips within reach are deemed collected."
msgstr "触手可及的筹码，视同已收取。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "The House does not consider this a habit."
msgstr "庄家不认为这算上瘾。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Near misses are counted. All of them."
msgstr "每次擦身而过都会被计数。一次不落。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Approved routes pay better."
msgstr "经批准的路线，回报更高。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Nothing dropped is lost. It is redistributed."
msgstr "掉落之物不算丢失。只是重新分配。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Paid by the meter. Every meter is checked."
msgstr "按米计酬。每一米都要核查。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "One more go. The House counts goes."
msgstr "再来一次。庄家记着次数。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Cover by the House, which also sets the risk."
msgstr "由庄家承保，风险也由庄家来定。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Holding on is encouraged."
msgstr "鼓励你抓紧不放。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Early exits are processed quickly, and noted."
msgstr "提前离场，快速办理，并予以记录。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Not theft. Settlement between participants."
msgstr "这不是偷窃。是参与者之间的结算。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Everything comes back eventually."
msgstr "该回来的，终究会回来。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Past performance carries over. So does the record."
msgstr "过往业绩照常结转。记录也一样。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "The House never loads dice. It offers them."
msgstr "庄家从不给骰子灌铅。只是把它递给你。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Earn from the work of others, as is customary."
msgstr "按照惯例，从他人的劳动中获利。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Style is a measurable output."
msgstr "风格是一项可量化的产出。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Protection while stocks last."
msgstr "保护服务，售完即止。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Fuel is issued to licensed drivers only."
msgstr "燃油仅发放给持证车手。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Moved for you. You will not be asked."
msgstr "已代你划转。不会征询你的意见。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Formerly a day of the month."
msgstr "曾经是每月的某一天。"

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Higher stakes, for those who accept them."
msgstr "更高的赌注，留给愿意接受的人。"

