msgstr "终场哨后"

#. Kit's notes and the House's papers. Kit writes by hand and signs —K.; the House types in capitals. Keep a run of dots between a label and its value, and a " · " between items.
#: scripts/story/story_notes.gd
msgid "stayed after the whistle once to watch the crowd go home. they didn't. the lights went down and they just stood there, all of them, facing the table. i left. i don't think they noticed. i don't think they notice anything"
msgstr "有一次终场哨响了我没走，想看看看台上那群人怎么回家。他们没回。灯暗下来，他们就那么站着，一个不落，脸朝着赌桌。我走了。我觉得他们没发现。我觉得他们什么都发现不了"

