#. Kit's notes and the House's papers. Kit writes by hand and signs —K.; the House types in capitals. Keep a run of dots between a label and its value, and a " · " between items.
#: scripts/story/story_notes.gd
msgid "Worked out what the bots are. They're us. Every one is somebody who plays here, averaged. There's a Hunter that brakes exactly the way I brake. So I stopped braking like that. Next day, so had it. —K."
msgstr "想明白机器人是什么了。就是我们。每一个都是在这儿玩的人，取了个平均。有个猎手型，刹车跟我一模一样。于是我不那么刹了。第二天，它也不那么刹了。—K."

#. Kit's notes and the House's papers. Kit writes by hand and signs —K.; the House types in capitals. Keep a run of dots between a label and its value, and a " · " between items.
