msgid "started driving stupid on purpose. braking on straights, shooting walls, sitting in the jackpot with nobody near. the bots couldn't follow it. next day the House sent me a letter. it said THANK YOU. for what??"
msgstr "开始故意乱开。直道上踩刹车，朝墙开枪，附近没人也蹲在头奖里。机器人跟不上。第二天庄家给我寄了封信，上面写着“谢谢”。谢我什么？？"

