#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Bank Shot"
msgstr "两库翻袋"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Take out a kart with a bullet that bounced off two walls"
msgstr "用一颗在两面墙上反弹过的子弹击杀一辆卡丁车"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Parry"
msgstr "见招拆招"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Shoot down five bullets of other karts in one life"
msgstr "在一条命内击落其他卡丁车的五颗子弹"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Long Shot"
msgstr "百步穿杨"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Take out a kart 25 m away or more"
msgstr "击杀一辆 25 米或更远处的卡丁车"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Payback"
msgstr "以牙还牙"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Take out whoever took you out within 10 s of coming back, three times in one map"
msgstr "在一张地图中三次做到：复活后 10 秒内击杀刚刚击杀你的人"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Take out a kart cashing out on the Junction at Match Point"
msgstr "击杀一辆处于赛点、正在路口兑现的卡丁车"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Untouchable"
msgstr "所向披靡"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Take out eight karts without dying"
msgstr "在不阵亡的情况下击杀八辆卡丁车"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Tough as Nails"
msgstr "钢筋铁骨"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Take ten hits without dying"
msgstr "在不阵亡的情况下被击中十次"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Two Birds"
msgstr "一石二鸟"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Take out two karts with one bomb"
msgstr "用一颗炸弹击杀两辆卡丁车"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Set and Forget"
msgstr "一劳永逸"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Have one turret take out three karts"
msgstr "让一座炮塔击杀三辆卡丁车"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Push Comes to Shove"
msgstr "落井下石"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Knock three karts into pits in one map"
msgstr "在一张地图中把三辆卡丁车撞进坑洞"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "A Pit. Do Not."
msgstr "坑洞。切勿。"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Drive into a pit carrying a pot worth 1,000 or more"
msgstr "带着价值 1,000 或以上的彩池开进坑洞"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "A Real Handful"
msgstr "满手小丑"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Hold nine jokers at once"
msgstr "同时持有九张小丑牌"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Stacked"
msgstr "叠叠乐"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Hold two jokers at full stacks at once"
msgstr "同时持有两张叠满层数的小丑牌"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Asking for Trouble"
msgstr "自讨苦吃"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Win a map holding three cursed jokers"
msgstr "持有三张诅咒小丑牌赢下一张地图"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Suit Yourself"
msgstr "花样百出"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Make every hand, and be Suited in every suit"
msgstr "打出每一种牌型，并用每种花色各达成一次同花色"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Full Deck"
msgstr "整副到手"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Take every joker at least once"
msgstr "每张小丑牌都至少拿过一次"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Toybox"
msgstr "百宝箱"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Use every power-up at least once"
msgstr "每种道具都至少使用一次"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Plus One"
msgstr "携伴出席"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Play a map with somebody else at the same screen"
msgstr "和另一个人在同一块屏幕上玩一张地图"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Long Distance"
msgstr "天涯若比邻"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Play a map online with somebody at another machine"
msgstr "与另一台机器前的人在线玩一张地图"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Full Table"
msgstr "座无虚席"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Play an online map with eight karts at the table, bots counting"
msgstr "在线玩一张赌桌上坐满八辆卡丁车的地图，机器人也算"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Front Row"
msgstr "前排围观"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Watch an online map from its flag to its whistle, and send some emotes while you do"
msgstr "在线观看一张地图，从发车旗看到终场哨，并在观看时发几个表情"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Dressed to the Nines"
msgstr "盛装登场"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Wear something in all seven parts of the dress at once"
msgstr "同时在装扮的全部七个部位都穿戴上东西"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Know Every Street"
msgstr "轻车熟路"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Win every landmark of one district of the loyalty program"
msgstr "赢下会员计划中一个街区的全部地标"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Most Valued Member"
msgstr "至尊会员"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Win every landmark on the House's map"
msgstr "赢下庄家地图上的全部地标"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Lap of Luxury"
msgstr "尊享一圈"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Drive a lap of the roundabout: win all seven of its bets"
msgstr "绕环岛开一圈：赢下它的全部七个赌注"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Off the Books"
msgstr "账外一笔"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Find a note"
msgstr "找到一张纸条"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Stamp the House's evaluation"
msgstr "在庄家的评估上盖章"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Not This Time"
msgstr "这次不行"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Tear the House's evaluation off"
msgstr "撕掉庄家的评估"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Employee of the Month"
msgstr "本月最佳员工"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Play a map after the ending"
msgstr "在结局之后玩一张地图"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Under the Floorboards"
msgstr "地板之下"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Take all five of Kit's cards"
msgstr "拿到 Kit 的全部五张牌"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "A Fresh Start"
msgstr "新的开始"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Find every note of the story"
msgstr "找到故事中的每一张纸条"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Buzzer Beater"
msgstr "压哨绝杀"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Take the lead with a cash-out in a map's last 5 seconds, and win it"
msgstr "在一张地图的最后 5 秒内靠兑现取得领先，并最终获胜"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Winner Takes All"
msgstr "赢家通吃"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Win a Grand Prix in its showdown"
msgstr "通过摊牌对决赢下一场大奖赛"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Partners in Crime"
msgstr "狼狈为奸"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Cash out on the Junction at the same time as a teammate, and win the map as a team against two or more"
msgstr "与队友同时在路口兑现，并作为一支队伍对阵至少两名对手赢下这张地图"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Snatch and Grab"
msgstr "半路截胡"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Take out a kart collecting a Jackpot, then empty that pile yourself"
msgstr "击杀一辆正在收集头奖的卡丁车，然后亲手把那堆筹码清空"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Make three Royal Flushes in one map"
msgstr "在一张地图中打出三次皇家同花顺"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Road Hog"
msgstr "路霸"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Take out two karts with one Boost"
msgstr "用一次加速击杀两辆卡丁车"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Slick Operator"
msgstr "老油条"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Spin out three karts on one oil slick"
msgstr "用一摊油渍让三辆卡丁车打滑"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Dead Ringer"
msgstr "以假乱真"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Have your decoy take out a kart"
msgstr "让你的诱饵击杀一辆卡丁车"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Long Way Round"
msgstr "一漂到底"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Hold one drift for 15 seconds"
msgstr "一次漂移保持 15 秒"

#. title
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Property Damage"
msgstr "损坏公物"

#. objective
#: data/achievements/list.tres
msgid "Break 250 crates"
msgstr "打碎 250 个木箱"

#. display name
#: data/ai/traits/balanced.tres
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "均衡型"

#. display name
#: data/ai/traits/bumper.tres
msgid "Bumper"
msgstr "冲撞型"

#. display name
#: data/ai/traits/cautious.tres
msgid "Cautious"
msgstr "谨慎型"

#. display name
#: data/ai/traits/grazer.tres
msgid "Grazer"
msgstr "擦弹型"

#. display name
#: data/ai/traits/greedy.tres
msgid "Greedy"
msgstr "贪婪型"

#. display name
#: data/ai/traits/hunter.tres
msgid "Hunter"
msgstr "猎手型"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/aimbot.tres
msgid "Aimbot"
msgstr "自瞄"

#. description
#: data/jokers/aimbot.tres
msgid "Every shot leaves the barrel aimed up to {deg} toward the nearest enemy."
msgstr "每次射击，子弹出膛时都会朝最近的敌人偏转最多 {deg}。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/backfire.tres
msgid "Backfire"
msgstr "回火"

#. description
#: data/jokers/backfire.tres
msgid "Hold the brake, or drift, and your cannon points out of the back of the kart."
msgstr "按住刹车或漂移时，你的炮口会朝向车尾。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/big_tank.tres
msgid "Big Tank"
msgstr "扩容弹匣"

#. description
#: data/jokers/big_tank.tres
msgid "{bullets} max live bullets."
msgstr "同时在场的子弹上限 {bullets}。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/blind_spot.tres
msgid "Blind Spot"
msgstr "盲区"

#. description
#: data/jokers/blind_spot.tres
msgid "Bots aim at where you are, never at where you are going. No standings board while you hold it."
msgstr "机器人只瞄准你现在的位置，从不瞄准你要去的位置。持有期间看不到排名。"

#. kit line
#: data/jokers/blind_spot.tres
msgid "If they can't guess you, they can't aim."
msgstr "猜不透你，就瞄不准你。"

#. kit back
#: data/jokers/blind_spot.tres
msgid "They don't aim at you. They aim at the you they expect. Give them nothing to expect. —K."
msgstr "他们瞄的不是你，是他们预想中的你。别给他们任何可以预想的东西。—K."

#. display name
#: data/jokers/brake_check.tres
msgid "Brake Check"
msgstr "急刹"

#. description
#: data/jokers/brake_check.tres
msgid "A dead stop with chips in the pot: +1 mult, three a life, one every 8 seconds. Top speed 10% down."
msgstr "彩池里有筹码时完全停下：倍率 +1，每条命最多三次，每 8 秒一次。最高速度降低 10%。"

#. kit line
#: data/jokers/brake_check.tres
msgid "Brake on a straight now and then. It hates that."
msgstr "时不时在直道上踩一脚刹车。它最恨这个。"

#. kit back
#: data/jokers/brake_check.tres
msgid "The models never brake on a straight. Nobody would, they figured. So I did, every lap, for a week, and they wrote a memo about it. —K."
msgstr "模型从不在直道上刹车。他们觉得，谁会那么干呢。于是我就那么干了，每圈都刹，整整一个礼拜，他们还为此专门写了份备忘录。—K."

#. display name
#: data/jokers/burnout.tres
msgid "Burnout"
msgstr "烧胎"

#. description
#: data/jokers/burnout.tres
msgid "Your jokers count every drift boost as a turbo pad."
msgstr "你的小丑牌会把每次漂移加速都算作一次加速垫。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/carbon_copy.tres
msgid "Carbon Copy"
msgstr "一式两份"

#. description
#: data/jokers/carbon_copy.tres
msgid "A joker your death drops is a copy: you keep your own."
msgstr "你阵亡时掉落的小丑牌只是副本：你自己的那张仍归你。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/comeback.tres
msgid "Comeback"
msgstr "东山再起"

#. description
#: data/jokers/comeback.tres
msgid "Respawn with mult equal to half your mult at death, rounded up."
msgstr "复活时，倍率为阵亡时倍率的一半，向上取整。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/copy_cat.tres
msgid "Copy Cat"
msgstr "照猫画虎"

#. description
#: data/jokers/copy_cat.tres
msgid "Counts as one more copy of the joker just before it in your hand, even past its most. Only a joker that stacks."
msgstr "算作你手牌中紧挨在它前面那张小丑牌的又一张副本，即使超出那张牌的上限也算。仅限可叠加的小丑牌。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/curve_ball.tres
msgid "Curve Ball"
msgstr "弧线球"

#. description
#: data/jokers/curve_ball.tres
msgid "Your bullets curve hard toward enemies, turning up to {turn} a second, further out, and keep curving after a bounce."
msgstr "你的子弹会急转追向敌人，每秒最多转 {turn}，追踪距离更远，反弹后仍会继续拐弯。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/cushion_shot.tres
msgid "Cushion Shot"
msgstr "库边球"

#. description
#: data/jokers/cushion_shot.tres
msgid "+{coins} every time one of your bullets bounces off a wall."
msgstr "你的子弹每在墙上反弹一次，+{coins}。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/daredevil.tres
msgid "Daredevil"
msgstr "拼命三郎"

#. description
#: data/jokers/daredevil.tres
msgid "A graze while you are wounded patches you up."
msgstr "受伤时只要擦弹一次，就能把你修好。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/deep_pockets.tres
msgid "Deep Pockets"
msgstr "百宝袋"

#. description
#: data/jokers/deep_pockets.tres
msgid "{slots} joker slots, and every Deep Pockets stands in one of them."
msgstr "小丑牌栏位 {slots}，每张百宝袋各占其中一格。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/direct_debit.tres
msgid "Direct Debit"
msgstr "自动扣款"

#. description
#: data/jokers/direct_debit.tres
msgid "{points} points of your pot bank themselves every second, wherever you are. Your mult is left alone."
msgstr "无论你身在何处，彩池每秒都会自动入账 {points} 点。你的倍率保持不变。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/double_tap.tres
msgid "Double Tap"
msgstr "补枪"

#. description
#: data/jokers/double_tap.tres
msgid "Your bullets wait out only {share} of a wounded kart's moment of grace."
msgstr "受伤卡丁车的无敌时间，你的子弹只需等待其中的 {share}。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/echo.tres
msgid "Echo"
msgstr "回响"

#. description
#: data/jokers/echo.tres
msgid "Your jokers that pay chips or mult pay again one time in four."
msgstr "会给筹码或倍率的小丑牌，每四次就有一次再给一遍。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/flush_draw.tres
msgid "Flush Draw"
msgstr "同花听牌"

#. description
#: data/jokers/flush_draw.tres
msgid "Two cards of a suit are enough to be Suited."
msgstr "同一花色只要有两张牌，就能算作同花色。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/getaway_driver.tres
msgid "Getaway Driver"
msgstr "跑路司机"

#. description
#: data/jokers/getaway_driver.tres
msgid "Junction drain ramps {times} as fast."
msgstr "在路口兑现时，流速攀升快到{times}倍。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/glass_jackpot.tres
msgid "Glass Jackpot"
msgstr "玻璃头奖"

#. description
#: data/jokers/glass_jackpot.tres
msgid "Completed cash-outs pay 150%, but dying drops all your chips and 2 jokers."
msgstr "完整的兑现按 150% 赔付，但阵亡会掉光所有筹码和 2 张小丑牌。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/green_light.tres
msgid "Green Light"
msgstr "绿灯"

#. description
#: data/jokers/green_light.tres
msgid "Turbo pads give {mult} mult."
msgstr "加速垫给予 {mult} 倍率。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/guardian_angel.tres
msgid "Guardian Angel"
msgstr "守护天使"

#. description
#: data/jokers/guardian_angel.tres
msgid "A hit about to cost you a life uses your Shield or Bullet Wipe instead."
msgstr "即将让你丢掉一条命的攻击，会改为消耗你的护盾或清弹。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/hair_trigger.tres
msgid "Hair Trigger"
msgstr "一触即发"

#. description
#: data/jokers/hair_trigger.tres
msgid "Fire cooldown {cut}."
msgstr "射击冷却 {cut}。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/high_roller.tres
msgid "High Roller"
msgstr "豪客"

#. description
#: data/jokers/high_roller.tres
msgid "All mult gains are doubled, but death banks 0%."
msgstr "获得的倍率全部翻倍，但阵亡时入账 0%。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/hot_streak.tres
msgid "Hot Streak"
msgstr "手气正旺"

#. description
#: data/jokers/hot_streak.tres
msgid "{mult} mult every 10 seconds you stay on the floor."
msgstr "每在场上待满 10 秒，获得 {mult} 倍率。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/insurance_policy.tres
msgid "Insurance Policy"
msgstr "保险单"

#. description
#: data/jokers/insurance_policy.tres
msgid "Bank all that is left of your pot on death."
msgstr "阵亡时，彩池里剩下的全部入账。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/jerry_can.tres
msgid "Jerry Can"
msgstr "备用油桶"

#. description
#: data/jokers/jerry_can.tres
msgid "Nitro refills {times} as fast."
msgstr "氮气回充速度快到{times}倍。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/loaded_dice.tres
msgid "Loaded Dice"
msgstr "灌铅骰子"

#. description
#: data/jokers/loaded_dice.tres
msgid "Every chip has a {chance} chance to count as a gold chip."
msgstr "每枚筹码都有 {chance} 的几率算作金筹码。"

#. description
#: data/jokers/loose_change.tres
msgid "The chips you drop never fade back to the House. You drop half again as many."
msgstr "你掉落的筹码再也不会消散回庄家手里。你掉落的数量也多一半。"

#. kit line
#: data/jokers/loose_change.tres
msgid "What they don't pick up isn't theirs."
msgstr "他们没捡走的，就不归他们。"

#. kit back
#: data/jokers/loose_change.tres
msgid "Everything that hits their floor goes back to them, sooner or later. Not this. Let somebody else have it. —K."
msgstr "掉在他们地板上的东西，迟早都会回到他们手里。这个不会。留给别人吧。—K."

#. display name
#: data/jokers/lucky_charm.tres
msgid "Lucky Charm"
msgstr "幸运符"

#. description
#: data/jokers/lucky_charm.tres
msgid "Slot machines pay you a step better: a pair as three of a kind, three of a kind as three sevens."
msgstr "老虎机给你的赔付高一档：对子按三条算，三条按三个 7 算。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/lucky_seven.tres
msgid "Lucky Seven"
msgstr "幸运七"

#. description
#: data/jokers/lucky_seven.tres
msgid "Every 7 chips you collect give {mult} mult, a gold chip counting as five."
msgstr "每收集 7 枚筹码获得 {mult} 倍率，一枚金筹码算作五枚。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/magnet_hubcaps.tres
msgid "Magnet Hubcaps"
msgstr "磁力轮毂"

#. description
#: data/jokers/magnet_hubcaps.tres
msgid "Pickup radius times {times}."
msgstr "拾取半径变为{times}倍。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/nitro_habit.tres
msgid "Nitro Habit"
msgstr "氮气成瘾"

#. description
#: data/jokers/nitro_habit.tres
msgid "Drift exit boosts and turbo pads last {times} as long."
msgstr "漂移出弯加速和加速垫的持续时间延长到{times}倍。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/not_today.tres
msgid "Not Today"
msgstr "今天不行"

#. description
#: data/jokers/not_today.tres
msgid "Skip a pick: +2 mult when you come back. Take one of theirs: 1 mult off."
msgstr "跳过一次挑选：复活时 +2 倍率。拿走一张他们的牌：倍率 -1。"

#. kit line
#: data/jokers/not_today.tres
msgid "Say no to one of theirs."
msgstr "对他们的牌说一次不。"

#. kit back
#: data/jokers/not_today.tres
msgid "Every card they deal you is a question, and the answer they want is yes. This one is for the other answer. —K."
msgstr "他们发给你的每一张牌都是一个问题，他们想听的答案是“要”。这张是留给另一个答案的。—K."

#. display name
#: data/jokers/odometer.tres
msgid "Odometer"
msgstr "里程表"

#. description
#: data/jokers/odometer.tres
msgid "+{coins} for every 20 m you drive, meters on nitro counting double."
msgstr "每行驶 20 米 +{coins}，开着氮气跑的里程按双倍算。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/pack_rat.tres
msgid "Pack Rat"
msgstr "囤货狂"

#. description
#: data/jokers/pack_rat.tres
msgid "{items} items in reserve, brought out as the one in hand is used."
msgstr "储备道具 {items}，手上的道具用掉后自动补上。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/payday.tres
msgid "Payday"
msgstr "发薪日"

#. description
#: data/jokers/payday.tres
msgid "+{coins} every second, wherever you are."
msgstr "无论你身在何处，每秒 +{coins}。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/pickpocket.tres
msgid "Pickpocket"
msgstr "扒手"

#. description
#: data/jokers/pickpocket.tres
msgid "Kills move 50% of the victim's chips into your pot; the victim drops none."
msgstr "击杀会把对方 50% 的筹码转进你的彩池；对方不会掉落筹码。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/pit_crew.tres
msgid "Pit Crew"
msgstr "维修组"

#. description
#: data/jokers/pit_crew.tres
msgid "Turbo pads refill {share} of your nitro tank, once every 3 s."
msgstr "加速垫为你的氮气罐补充{share}，每 3 秒至多一次。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/road_rage.tres
msgid "Road Rage"
msgstr "路怒症"

#. description
#: data/jokers/road_rage.tres
msgid "Ramming above 90% of top speed kills without Boost, but top speed is -10%."
msgstr "以极速 90% 以上的速度撞击时，无需加速也能击杀，但极速 -10%。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/royal_court.tres
msgid "Royal Court"
msgstr "王庭"

#. description
#: data/jokers/royal_court.tres
msgid "Come back with +1 mult for every Cursed joker you hold."
msgstr "复活时，你每持有一张诅咒小丑牌，就获得 +1 倍率。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/rubber_bumpers.tres
msgid "Rubber Bumpers"
msgstr "橡胶保险杠"

#. description
#: data/jokers/rubber_bumpers.tres
msgid "Your bullets bounce off walls {more} more."
msgstr "你的子弹可以在墙上多反弹{more}次。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/scar_tissue.tres
msgid "Scar Tissue"
msgstr "伤疤"

#. description
#: data/jokers/scar_tissue.tres
msgid "{lives}, but nothing heals you: only coming back does."
msgstr "{lives}，但什么都治不好你，只有复活才行。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/second_wind.tres
msgid "Second Wind"
msgstr "重振旗鼓"

#. description
#: data/jokers/second_wind.tres
msgid "Come back with a full tank of nitro and a Boost running."
msgstr "复活时氮气全满，并且加速正在生效。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/slipstream.tres
msgid "Slipstream"
msgstr "尾流"

#. description
#: data/jokers/slipstream.tres
msgid "Grazes give {mult} mult instead of +0.5."
msgstr "擦弹给予 {mult} 倍率，而不是 +0.5。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/snake_eyes.tres
msgid "Snake Eyes"
msgstr "蛇眼"

#. description
#: data/jokers/snake_eyes.tres
msgid "Start every life with mult 3, but grazes give nothing."
msgstr "每条命开局倍率为 3，但擦弹毫无收益。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/snowball.tres
msgid "Snowball"
msgstr "滚雪球"

#. description
#: data/jokers/snowball.tres
msgid "Fire rate +10% for every kill this life, up to +50%."
msgstr "本条命中每击杀一次，射速 +10%，最多 +50%。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/spare_tire.tres
msgid "Spare Tire"
msgstr "备胎"

#. description
#: data/jokers/spare_tire.tres
msgid "{lives}. Lost when you die."
msgstr "{lives}。阵亡时失去。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/tailslide.tres
msgid "Tailslide"
msgstr "甩尾"

#. description
#: data/jokers/tailslide.tres
msgid "+{coins} for every 8 m you drift."
msgstr "每漂移 8 米 +{coins}。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/tight_grip.tres
msgid "Tight Grip"
msgstr "一毛不拔"

#. description
#: data/jokers/tight_grip.tres
msgid "Your pot never spills: no chips dropped on death or knocked out by a ram."
msgstr "你的彩池绝不外洒：阵亡时不掉筹码，被撞时也撞不掉。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/toll_booth.tres
msgid "Toll Booth"
msgstr "收费站"

#. description
#: data/jokers/toll_booth.tres
msgid "Whenever another kart completes a cash-out, you bank {share} of it."
msgstr "每当其他卡丁车完成一次兑现，你也入账其中的 {share}。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/under_the_table.tres
msgid "Under the Table"
msgstr "台底交易"

#. description
#: data/jokers/under_the_table.tres
msgid "Your bank is off the standings until the whistle: no bounty, no match point. Last Call pays you single."
msgstr "终场哨响之前，你的入账不计入排名：没有悬赏，也没有赛点。最后一轮只给你单倍。"

#. kit line
#: data/jokers/under_the_table.tres
msgid "Keep it off their board."
msgstr "别上他们的榜。"

#. kit back
#: data/jokers/under_the_table.tres
msgid "Their board is how they keep count of you. Stay off it for a while and watch what they do. —K."
msgstr "他们靠那块榜记你的账。离它远一阵子，看看他们会怎么做。—K."

#. display name
#: data/jokers/vulture.tres
msgid "Vulture"
msgstr "秃鹫"

#. description
#: data/jokers/vulture.tres
msgid "Chips dropped by other karts are worth {coins} to you."
msgstr "其他卡丁车掉落的每枚筹码，对你来说都值 {coins}。"

#. display name
#: data/jokers/wild_card.tres
msgid "Wild Card"
msgstr "百搭牌"

#. description
#: data/jokers/wild_card.tres
msgid "Respawn offers {offers} jokers instead of 3."
msgstr "复活时可从 {offers} 张小丑牌中挑选，而不是 3 张。"

