#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "The Body Shop"
msgstr "钣金店"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Lost Property, the School"
msgstr "失物招领·驾校"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Lost at the driving school, out past the cones"
msgstr "遗失在驾校，锥桶外头"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Lost Property, the Yard"
msgstr "失物招领·货场"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Lost in the Yard, by the warehouse doors"
msgstr "遗失在货场，仓库门边"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Lost Property, the Workbench"
msgstr "失物招领·工作台"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Lost in the Workbench, up against a wall"
msgstr "遗失在工作台，紧贴着墙"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Lost Property, After Hours"
msgstr "失物招领·夜场"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Lost in After Hours, in a dark corner"
msgstr "遗失在夜场，某个黑暗角落"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "The Long Haul"
msgstr "长途跋涉"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "The Showroom"
msgstr "展厅"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Win three maps in a row, one in each of the three rooms"
msgstr "连赢三张地图，三个厅各赢一张"

#. endorsement
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "ADVANCED"
msgstr "高级"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "pencils"
msgstr "铅笔"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Find {count} notes"
msgstr "找到 {count} 张纸条"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "seven exactly"
msgstr "刚好七枚"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Cash out a pot of exactly {count} chips"
msgstr "兑现一个刚好 {count} 枚筹码的彩池"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "no thank you"
msgstr "不了，谢谢"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Skip every joker offered in a map, {count} or more of them"
msgstr "一张地图里发给你的小丑牌全部跳过，至少 {count} 张"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "torn up"
msgstr "撕了"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Destroy a rare joker"
msgstr "销毁一张稀有小丑牌"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "empty handed"
msgstr "两手空空"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Win a map without ever taking a joker"
msgstr "一张小丑牌都不拿，赢下一张地图"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "quiet hours"
msgstr "安静时间"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "A map of {count} or more without firing a shot"
msgstr "一枪不开打完一张地图，时长至少 {count}"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "walk away"
msgstr "转身走人"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Drive off the Junction with {count} chips or more still in the pot"
msgstr "彩池里还有 {count} 枚或更多筹码时驶离路口"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "left on the floor"
msgstr "扔在地上"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Drop a full hand of jokers in one map"
msgstr "在一张地图里掉落一整手小丑牌"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "no strings"
msgstr "无牵无挂"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Win a map without picking up a power-up"
msgstr "不捡任何道具，赢下一张地图"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "house money"
msgstr "庄家的钱"

#. bet
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "Cash out {count} or more with an empty hand"
msgstr "手里没有小丑牌时兑现 {count} 或更多"

#. title
#: data/loyalty/map.tres
msgid "the back roads"
msgstr "小道"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/bomb.tres
msgid "Bomb"
msgstr "炸弹"

#. description
#: data/powerups/bomb.tres
msgid "Drops a bomb behind you. It goes off under any kart, when shot, or in time, and its kills are yours."
msgstr "在身后放下一颗炸弹。有卡丁车从上面开过、被子弹击中或时间一到都会爆炸，炸死的都算你的击杀。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/boomerang.tres
msgid "Boomerang"
msgstr "回旋镖"

#. description
#: data/powerups/boomerang.tres
msgid "Your next shots fly out and curve back, able to hit both ways."
msgstr "你接下来的射击会飞出去再绕回来，去程回程都能命中。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/boost.tres
msgid "Boost"
msgstr "加速"

#. description
#: data/powerups/boost.tres
msgid "Faster, and ramming kills. Bullets still hurt."
msgstr "速度更快，撞击即可击杀。子弹照样会伤到你。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/bullet_wipe.tres
msgid "Bullet Wipe"
msgstr "清弹"

#. description
#: data/powerups/bullet_wipe.tres
msgid "Erases every bullet near you."
msgstr "抹掉你附近的所有子弹。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/chain_lightning.tres
msgid "Chain Lightning"
msgstr "连锁闪电"

#. description
#: data/powerups/chain_lightning.tres
msgid "Your next shots leap from what they hit to the next kart, turret or crate nearby."
msgstr "你接下来的射击命中后，会跳向附近的下一辆卡丁车、炮塔或木箱。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/coin_magnet.tres
msgid "Chip Magnet"
msgstr "筹码磁铁"

#. description
#: data/powerups/coin_magnet.tres
msgid "Chips come flying to you from further off."
msgstr "筹码会从更远的地方飞向你。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/decoy_kart.tres
msgid "Decoy Kart"
msgstr "诱饵卡丁车"

#. description
#: data/powerups/decoy_kart.tres
msgid "A bot copy of you fights on your side. Its kills and chips are yours, and it can hit you."
msgstr "一个机器人版的你站在你这边作战。它的击杀和筹码都归你，但它也可能打中你。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/flak_cannon.tres
msgid "Flak Cannon"
msgstr "破片炮"

#. description
#: data/powerups/flak_cannon.tres
msgid "Your next shots airburst into a spray of pellets at range."
msgstr "你接下来的射击飞到远处会凌空炸开，散成一片弹丸。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/grenade.tres
msgid "Grenade"
msgstr "榴弹"

#. description
#: data/powerups/grenade.tres
msgid "Your next shots bounce off walls and burst on a short fuse."
msgstr "你接下来的射击会在墙上反弹，引信很短，转眼就炸。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/oil_stain.tres
msgid "Oil Stain"
msgstr "油渍"

#. description
#: data/powerups/oil_stain.tres
msgid "Leaves a slick behind you. Whoever drives over it spins out, you too."
msgstr "在身后留下一摊油。谁开上去都会打滑失控，你也不例外。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/proximity_mine.tres
msgid "Proximity Mine"
msgstr "感应地雷"

#. description
#: data/powerups/proximity_mine.tres
msgid "Your next shots are lobbed traps that burst when an enemy drives near."
msgstr "你接下来的射击会抛出陷阱，敌人一靠近就爆炸。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/railgun.tres
msgid "Railgun"
msgstr "磁轨炮"

#. description
#: data/powerups/railgun.tres
msgid "Your next shots are fast bolts that pierce clean through a line of karts."
msgstr "你接下来的射击是高速电磁弹，能干脆利落地贯穿一整排卡丁车。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/ricochet_cannon.tres
msgid "Ricochet Cannon"
msgstr "跳弹炮"

#. description
#: data/powerups/ricochet_cannon.tres
msgid "Your next shots bounce off walls once more and fly faster."
msgstr "你接下来的射击可以在墙上多反弹一次，飞得也更快。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/rocket.tres
msgid "Rocket"
msgstr "火箭"

#. description
#: data/powerups/rocket.tres
msgid "Your next shots are slow homing rockets that burst where they hit."
msgstr "你接下来的射击是缓慢的追踪火箭，命中即爆炸。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/scrambler.tres
msgid "Scrambler"
msgstr "干扰器"

#. description
#: data/powerups/scrambler.tres
msgid "Your next shots take no life but jam the hit kart's cannon for a few seconds."
msgstr "你接下来的射击不会夺命，但会让被击中的卡丁车的炮卡壳几秒。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/shield.tres
msgid "Shield"
msgstr "护盾"

#. description
#: data/powerups/shield.tres
msgid "Takes one bullet or ram for you, then pops."
msgstr "替你挡下一发子弹或一次撞击，然后破裂。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/spread_cannon.tres
msgid "Spread Cannon"
msgstr "散射炮"

#. description
#: data/powerups/spread_cannon.tres
msgid "Your next shots each fire a fan of bullets."
msgstr "你接下来的每次射击都会射出一排扇形子弹。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/sticky_bomb.tres
msgid "Sticky Bomb"
msgstr "粘弹"

#. description
#: data/powerups/sticky_bomb.tres
msgid "Your next shots stick to the kart they hit, then burst a moment later."
msgstr "你接下来的射击会粘在被击中的卡丁车上，片刻后爆炸。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/swivel_cannon.tres
msgid "Swivel Cannon"
msgstr "万向炮"

#. description
#: data/powerups/swivel_cannon.tres
msgid "Aim anywhere with the right stick, the mouse or a finger, with no aim assist."
msgstr "用右摇杆、鼠标或手指朝任意方向瞄准，没有辅助瞄准。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/turret.tres
msgid "Turret"
msgstr "炮塔"

#. description
#: data/powerups/turret.tres
msgid "Puts down a turret that shoots the nearest enemy. Its kills are yours, and it can hit you."
msgstr "放下一座炮塔，射击最近的敌人。它的击杀归你，但它也可能打中你。"

#. display name
#: data/powerups/windfall.tres
msgid "Windfall"
msgstr "横财"

#. description
#: data/powerups/windfall.tres
msgid "A pile of coins straight into your pot, more the further you are behind."
msgstr "一堆筹码直接进你的彩池，你落后越多，给得越多。"

#. display name
#: data/rooms/after_hours.tres
msgid "After Hours"
msgstr "夜场"

